# Paths the architecture does not claim (arc42 H021), relative to the root of lernapps/app-templates. The architecture
# is validated as the generic part plus one archetype's extension (scripts/arc42.ts). Another archetype's runtime is
# claimed by that archetype's extension, in its own combination; in the others only the files reused from it are.
runtime/quiz
runtime/explainer
runtime/interactive
# In each template folder, whose parts the extensions claim with the folder as prefix (interactive/src/core): the
# entry, which hands the app's parts to its archetype's shell, and type declarations, configuration rather than
# architecture; and the explainer's example chapter, part of bb-explainer-content (which claims src/app.yaml).
quiz/src/main.ts
# The quiz's image files: the content of the question bank (bb-quiz-bank claims src/quiz.json, whose figures name them),
# data like the bank and not a part of its own.
quiz/src/images
explainer/src/main.ts
explainer/src/prozent
# The explainer's image files: the figures of the example chapter, content like its pages and not a part of their own.
explainer/src/images
interactive/src/main.ts
interactive/src/env.d.ts
